# 基本文章編集から文字をウインドウの外へ運んで、待たずに離す (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py.
# As ui_doc_drop_cmp, but the hand goes out of the window and the button is let go at once,
# with no wait on the way: the process hears the hand go out (OB_E_LEAVE) and asks the desktop
# to carry the letters on (DT_RQ_CARRY with DT_F_TEXT) after the button went up, and the desktop
# lets them go where the button went up, onto the document TADjsについて the desktop opened at
# the start. Saved, record 0 of the copy is the one the desktop's own text editor, since
# removed, saved having carried the same letters out.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# The desktop's own editor this was once compared with is gone: what it saved and showed
# (record 0, its pictures) is what is wanted of the process here (want, shotsum).
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
drag 160 230 420 230
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
logmark
hold 300 230
move 400 240
move 600 300
move 800 420
move 900 450
up
expectsincein 10 document: letters carried out (0)
wait 500
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
want ok 5479 c7892d7d2e817f31
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
